        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Symptoms began approximately 4 days ago: frequent sneezing, blocked nose, clear rhinorrhoea, mildly itchy eyes, and mild frontal pressure when bending forward. Symptoms slightly increase at work and decrease away from the office. Possible triggers include workplace air conditioning or jasmine outside the patient's unit."
      }
